      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <details class="bh-faq-item" open>
          <summary class="bh-faq-summary">What carry positions is the Breakout 2.0 compatible with?</summary>
          <div class="bh-faq-answer">
            The Breakout 2.0 is an Inside-the-Waistband (IWB) holster optimized for <strong>Appendix Carry (12 to 1 o'clock)</strong> as well as <strong>Strong Side Hip Carry (3 to 4 o'clock)</strong>. The clip allows adjustable cant for customized angle preference.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bh-faq-item">
          <summary class="bh-faq-summary">What belt size does it work with?</summary>
          <div class="bh-faq-answer">
