          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bh-faq-item">
          <summary class="bh-faq-summary">Is it compatible with red dots and optics?</summary>
          <div class="bh-faq-answer">
            Yes! All Breakout 2.0 Holsters are molded with an optics relief cut that fits all standard micro and full-size slide-mounted optics (Holosun 407k/507k, Trijicon RMR, Shield RMS, Sig Romeo, etc.).
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bh-faq-item">
          <summary class="bh-faq-summary">Does it work with threaded barrels?</summary>
          <div class="bh-faq-answer">
            Yes, the open-muzzle bottom profile accommodates factory threaded barrels and standard compensators without obstruction.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="bh-faq-item">
          <summary class="bh-faq-summary">Will the retention loosen up over time?</summary>
          <div class="bh-faq-answer">
